# <%= current_page.data.title %>

## HTTPS

The GOV.UK Content API follows UK government HTTPS security guidelines. The API
platform uses Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure (HTTPS) over Transport Layer
Security (TLS) to provide secure connections.

## Security patches

The Government Digital Service (GDS) treats security vulnerabilities which are
discovered or reported as affecting the GOV.UK Content API as a high priority.

We assess and patch vulnerabilities when we identify them based on their severity
and impact, and regularly update framework and library dependencies to ensure we
incorporate the latest security fixes.

## Report a vulnerability

If you suspect a security vulnerability affecting the GOV.UK Content API, please
[read our security policy][security-policy] and [follow the steps][report-vuln]
to report the vulnerability.

Please do not publicly disclose the suspected vulnerability until you are informed
that it has been fixed.

[security-policy]: https://github.com/alphagov/.github/blob/master/SECURITY.md
[report-vuln]: https://github.com/alphagov/.github/blob/master/SECURITY.md#reporting-a-vulnerability
